Package: pkgdossier
Title: Compare What Users Meet Before and After a Package Upgrade
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Hamid", "Bulut", email = "me@hamidbulut.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Runs the code users learned from a package's released version
    (its vignettes, help-page examples or scenario scripts) unchanged under
    that release and under a candidate version, each installed in its own
    library and run in its own R process, and reports what a user meets
    after upgrading: new errors and warnings, changed printed output, moved
    numbers, removed or added object fields, changed plots and changes in
    run time. Each difference is labelled mechanically; deciding whether it
    is intended is left to the reader. Results are returned as data, written
    as JSON and rendered as a standalone HTML report.
